#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:5
msgid "PDF models"
msgstr "PDF predlošci"

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:7
msgid ""
"PDF models are provided for several outputs : an invoice model, a receipt "
"model and a membership from model are currently available. All of them "
"inherits from a `Global` model."
msgstr ""
"Dostupni su PDF predlošci za različite dokumente: račun, potvrdu o uplati i "
"pristupnicu. Svi nasljeđuju zajednički predložak `Global`."

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:9
msgid "PDF models management"
msgstr "Upravljanje PDF predlošcima"

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:15
msgid "Models inheritance"
msgstr "Nasljeđivanje predložaka"

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:17
msgid "The global model defines three distinct parts:"
msgstr "Zajednički predložak određuje tri dijela:"

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:19
msgid "header,"
msgstr "zaglavlje,"

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:20
msgid "footer,"
msgstr "podnožje,"

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:21
msgid "CSS styles."
msgstr "CSS stilove."

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:23
msgid ""
"Each model which inherits from `Global` will automatically obtain same "
"header and footer except if the new model redefines them, in which case only "
"specific values will be applied."
msgstr ""
"Svaki predložak koji nasljeđuje `Global` automatski dobiva isto zaglavlje i "
"podnožje, osim ako ih sam definira. Tada se koriste samo njegove vrijednosti."

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:25
msgid ""
"For CSS properties it is a bit different: `Global` model properties will "
"always be applied, and specific model properties will be appended (just like "
"real CSS stylesheets)."
msgstr ""
"CSS svojstva ponašaju se drukčije: svojstva predloška `Global` uvijek se "
"primjenjuju, a svojstva pojedinog predloška dodaju se iza njih, kao u pravim "
"CSS stilskim datotekama."

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:28
msgid "Generalities"
msgstr "Opće informacije"

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:30
msgid ""
"In addition of header, footer and CSS styles, a model defines a title, a sub "
"title and a body."
msgstr ""
"Osim zaglavlja, podnožja i CSS stilova predložak određuje naslov, podnaslov "
"i sadržaj."

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:32
msgid ""
"Each of those fields can take some replacement values, refer to the inline "
"help from the user interface to get details. They also can contains "
"internationalized texts like `_T(\"My text\")` that relies on Galette "
"standard translation capacities."
msgstr ""
"Ta polja mogu sadržavati zamjenske vrijednosti; pojedinosti potražite u "
"pomoći unutar sučelja. Mogu sadržavati i tekst za prijevod poput `_T(\"My "
"text\")`, koji koristi uobičajene mogućnosti prevođenja Galettea."

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:34
msgid ""
"``{ASSO_LOGO}`` inserts the logo of the association, and ``{ASSO_PRINT_LOGO}"
"`` the logo for printing set in the **Cards** tab of the preferences, which "
"is often better suited to paper."
msgstr ""
"``{ASSO_LOGO}`` umeće logotip udruge, a ``{ASSO_PRINT_LOGO}`` logotip za "
"ispis postavljen na kartici **Iskaznice**, često prikladniji za papir."

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:36
msgid ""
"Models rely on HTML and CSS styles, but keep in mind we are building a PDF "
"file, and not displaying a page in a recent browser; there are many "
"limitations."
msgstr ""
"Predlošci koriste HTML i CSS, ali izrađujemo PDF, a ne stranicu u novom "
"pregledniku, pa postoje brojna ograničenja."

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:39
msgid "Invoices and receipts"
msgstr "Računi i potvrde o uplati"

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:41
msgid "Invoice and receipt models are the same, excepting their titles."
msgstr "Predlošci računa i potvrde isti su osim naslova."

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:43
msgid "Invoice PDF model"
msgstr "PDF predložak računa"

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:48
msgid ""
"As you can see in the above screenshot, invoice model does not define any "
"header, footer or CSS styles, the ones form the `Global` model are used."
msgstr ""
"Na gornjoj slici predložak računa nema vlastito zaglavlje, podnožje ni CSS "
"stilove; koristi ih iz predloška `Global`."

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:51
msgid "Membership form"
msgstr "Pristupnica"

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:53
msgid ""
"It is a model that can be used to print a membership form. It can be empty "
"(to print some of them for any event for example) or filled with one member "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj predložak služi za ispis pristupnice. Može biti prazna, primjerice za "
"dijeljenje na događaju, ili ispunjena podacima jednog člana."

